<!--
  Sitemap for hwsbydanni.com

  lastmod is the date each page's CONTENT last changed. It is NOT the date git
  last touched the file: sitewide edits (the chat script added to every page on
  2026-09-20, the nav and footer rebuilt on 2026-09-21) touch all 22 pages at
  once, and dating every page to a scripted change tells Google the whole site
  was rewritten in one day. The usual result is that it stops trusting lastmod
  on this domain entirely.

  Run tools/sitemap_dates.py to derive these. It walks each page's history
  newest-first and stops at the first commit that still changes the page once
  the shared header and footer, scripts, comments and style attributes are
  stripped out, keeping the title and meta description because those are what
  a search result shows.

  The nine category pages are grouped under services.html below, in the same
  alphabetical order the site navigation uses. The URLs stay flat (/wigs.html,
  not /services/wigs.html) on purpose: GitHub Pages has no server-side
  redirects, so moving them would strand the URLs already submitted for
  indexing. The hierarchy is expressed in the navigation and in each page's
  BreadcrumbList instead.

  404.html is excluded on purpose. No changefreq or priority: Google ignores both.
-->
